.TE
.\" ===================================================================
.SH CONSTRAINTS AND INVARIANTS
These are the fundamental laws of the game engine.
They are never violated, and no command or sequence of commands can
circumvent them:
.IP \(bu 2
No randomness in combat\(emall outcomes are deterministic.
.IP \(bu 2
No hidden information\(emall game state is public.
.IP \(bu 2
Rules do not change mid-game.
.IP \(bu 2
Equal inputs yield equal outcomes.
.IP \(bu 2
Ships retain original tech level permanently.
.IP \(bu 2
Warp Generators never take damage.
A ship is destroyed when all attributes except WG reach 0.
.IP \(bu 2
SystemShips cannot have Warp Generators or SystemShip Racks.
.IP \(bu 2
WarpShips cannot be carried in SystemShip Racks.
.IP \(bu 2
Beams/Screens and Missiles cannot be used in the same combat round.
.IP \(bu 2
SystemShips may never select the Escape tactic.
.IP \(bu 2
PD used for movement is not permanently expended.
.IP \(bu 2
Repairs cannot exceed original built capacity.
.IP \(bu 2
Missile resupply cannot exceed original missile capacity.
.\" ===================================================================
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS "Building a WarpShip"
.nf
> \fBbn\fR W Falcon
> \fBbs\fR Falcon pd=5 b=3 s=2 t=1 m=3
> \fBbc\fR Falcon
.fi
.PP
Total cost: PD(5) + B(3) + S(2) + T(1) + M(1) + WG(5) = 17 BP.
Tech level determined by current round.
.SS "Building a SystemShip"
.nf
> \fBbn\fR S Avenger
> \fBbs\fR Avenger pd=1 t=1 m=6
> \fBbc\fR Avenger
.fi
.PP
Total cost: PD(1) + T(1) + M(2) = 4 BP.
No Warp Generator required.
.SS "Movement"
.nf
> \fBm\fR W6 Tavon Xylen
.fi
.PP
W6 moves from current hex to Tavon via the nearest warpline path,
then onward to Xylen.
Total PD cost depends on path length (BFS-computed).
.SS "Combat Sequence"
.nf
> \fBco\fR W3 a S25 pd=2 b=3 s=2
> \fBcc\fR
\fI(Wait for opponent to commit...)\fR
\fI(Resolution: W3 hits S25 for 3+tech damage)\fR
> \fBca\fR S25 pd=2 b=1
.fi
.SS "Missile Fire"
.nf
> \fBco\fR S25 d W3 pd=4 t=1 m=3
> \fBcc\fR
.fi
.PP
S25 dodges while firing 1 missile at W3.
The missile uses Attack tactic with drive=3.
Missile damage on hit = 2 + tech level.
.SS "Economic Workflow"
.nf
> \fBout\fR W1 lrs
> \fBsurvey\fR ARVEN
> \fBextract scan\fR
> \fBex\fR W1 ferrous
> \fBmarket\fR
> \fBtrade sell\fR ferrous 5
> \fBfab\fR missiles W1
.fi
.SS "Save and Load"
.nf
> \fBsave\fR my-game
> \fBload\fR my-game
\fI(Other player must type:)\fR
> \fBaccept\fR my-game
.fi
.SS "Quit"
.nf
> \fBquit\fR
\fIQUIT: Game auto-saved as 'autosaved-2026-02-13-14-30'.\fR
\fIReturning to lobby.\fR
.fi
The game is auto-saved.
Combat state is cleared.
The other player is notified and redirected.
The AI thread ceases operating on this game.
